{
  "name": "billiards-3d",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "一个纯前端、零构建的 3D 台球小游戏，基于 **Three.js** 渲染 + 自研轻量物理引擎， 带完整的**三维碰撞特效**：粒子火花、桌面冲击波、撞击闪光、镜头震动与实时合成音效。 支持**单人街机**与**本地同屏双人对战**（标准八球规则）两种模式。",
  "main": "server.js",
  "directories": {
    "lib": "lib"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js",
    "test": "node test/run-all.js",
    "test:phys": "node js/physics.test.js",
    "test:rules": "node js/rules.test.js",
    "test:protocol": "node js/protocol.test.js",
    "test:server": "node test-server.js"
  },
  "keywords": [],
  "author": "",
  "license": "ISC",
  "dependencies": {
    "ws": "^8.21.3"
  }
}